      "text": "Nashaxian's glaive Strike also deals 1d6 bleed that resists attempts to heal it.\n\nThe flat check to stop the bleeding starts at DC 20 Flat check. The DC is reduced to DC 15 Flat check only if the bleeding creature or an ally successfully assists with the recovery. The DC to Administer First Aid to a creature with an infernal wound is increased by 5.\n\nA spellcaster or item attempting to use healing magic on a creature suffering from an infernal wound must succeed at a DC 21 counteract check or the magic fails to heal the creature.\n\nEffect: Infernal Wound",
